  "body": "New Zealand's largest selection of relocatable houses. Check out more houses on our website at http://www.fordebrothers.co.nz \r\n\r\nHouse for removal-Stock name-Newstead\r\nA good cheap home. One peice simple shift with good conditon kitchen and bathroom. Ready to live in.\r\nView anytime O275599386\r\n\r\nPrice includes: \r\nDelivery within aprox 200 kms of Auckland. Will consider delivery to other areas, just ask. \r\nInstallation of standard depth pile foundations.\r\nIncludes GST. \r\n\r\nWe have 3 \"in house\" architects to draw plans and lodge your application with Council as well as geotech engineers and surveyors. A one stop shop for you!\r\n\r\nKEYWORDS: transportable home, transportable dwelling, transportable building, transportable house, relocatable house, relocatable dwelling, relocatable building, removable house, removable dwelling, removable home, removable building, villa, house for removal, building for removal, dwelling for removal, home for removal, house haulage, clear my site, houses for removal, homes for removal, buildings for removal, dwellings for removal, renovate, investment, house demolition, demolition, bungalow, character home, character dwelling, character building, development, investment opportunity, developments, preloved home, preloved house, secondhand house, second hand house, portable home, portable house.",
